==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|uphongen|lang=enm}}, equivalent to {{prefix|up|hang}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|uphangs|uphanging|uphung}}

# {{context|rare|lang=en}} To [[hang up]].
# {{context|rare|lang=en}} To [[suspend]] or [[fix]] aloft.
#* Edward Bulwer Lytton
#*: When soft stars were brightly '''uphanging''' the night.

